      <title>What’s Behind the Trump-Huang Relationship?</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/politics/100000011272223/whats-behind-the-trump-huang-relationship.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/politics/100000011272223/whats-behind-the-trump-huang-relationship.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 13:27:10 +0000</pubDate>
